# The editor gutter's right-click: the breakpoint menu, with Rust's git
# rows for the line at the end (Peek change / Toggle blame / Open on
# remote). At 120x40 the gutter of line 1 is column 31, row 2.
write a.txt "hello\n"
open a.txt
rightclick 31 2
expect screen contains "┌ Breakpoint"
expect screen contains "Add breakpoint"
expect screen contains "Peek change"
expect screen contains "Open on remote"
key esc
expect screen lacks "Peek change"
